# Copy to .env.local for local dev. Never commit the real file.
#
# PULSE_API_URL and PULSE_API_KEY are read ONLY by the server-side proxy
# at app/api/proxy/[...path]/route.ts. Deliberately NOT prefixed with
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ -- that prefix makes a variable visible in the browser
# bundle, which would leak the Pulse API key to anyone with devtools
# open. The browser never talks to the Pulse backend directly; it only
# ever calls this Next.js app's own /api/proxy/* routes, same-origin, no
# key required client-side. See that route file's docstring and
# docs/architecture.md's dashboard section for the full reasoning.

PULSE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
PULSE_API_KEY=changeme-generate-a-real-key
